    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game about a family who isolated themselves from the sinful outside world in pursuit of salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Caleb \u2014 the father, who enforces strict rules, raises his children in discipline, and maintains the household according to God's commandments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath this perfect facade, tension is slowly growing. As silence and unease settle over the house, an inner struggle begins \u2014 and it cannot be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark corners of the home, perform daily tasks, and try to hold onto your sanity as reality itself starts to twist and break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isolation and Routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live by strict rules. Care for the house, keep order, and oversee the behavior of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as familiar things become unsettling. Fear doesn't hide in monsters \u2014 it lingers in silence and glances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open doors, search rooms, find items and fragments of the story to piece together what truly happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Symbolism and Hidden Meanings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers no direct answers. Only careful observation and curiosity will reveal the dark truth concealed within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER</strong> is a story about faith, fear, and human frailty.<br> Will you manage to keep everything under control when the line between duty and madness begins to blur?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game about a family who isolated themselves from the sinful outside world in pursuit of salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/242c1e2d17a4bdfb9b2ad4fbeca72aa4.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Caleb \u2014 the father, who enforces strict rules, raises his children in discipline, and maintains the household according to God's commandments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath this perfect facade, tension is slowly growing. As silence and unease settle over the house, an inner struggle begins \u2014 and it cannot be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark corners of the home, perform daily tasks, and try to hold onto your sanity as reality itself starts to twist and break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/e37571206bec7748c0fcf20e612396ae.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isolation and Routine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live by strict rules. Care for the house, keep order, and oversee the behavior of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/4427f5bbdf0fe3e9a05c5c6e5499579b.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as familiar things become unsettling. Fear doesn't hide in monsters \u2014 it lingers in silence and glances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/78e3d729695e714dac853fc72abeb47a.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open doors, search rooms, find items and fragments of the story to piece together what truly happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.poster.avif?t=1754653577\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.webm?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2588830/extras/8782a5af4069d415cfe41ab5374780fc.mp4?t=1754653577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Symbolism and Hidden Meanings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers no direct answers. Only careful observation and curiosity will reveal the dark truth concealed within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FATHER</strong> is a story about faith, fear, and human frailty.<br> Will you manage to keep everything under control when the line between duty and madness begins to blur?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
